-- Reproduce #8910 with interactive highlighting: checking the module
-- application clears the import keyword after its tokens have been consumed
-- by the import declaration. The final application highlighting omits it.
-- The golden output records the current bug and needs updating when fixed.
IOTCM currentFile Interactive Direct (Cmd_load currentFile [])
-- The stored highlighting still includes the import keyword.
IOTCM currentFile NonInteractive Direct (Cmd_load_highlighting_info currentFile)
